        <mxCell id="Tt2F_d55VuvoBHy2sphz-2" parent="Tt2F_d55VuvoBHy2sphz-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#fad7ac;strokeColor=#b46504;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 153, 0);&quot;&gt;1. Vendor gazetting - they cannot check if they typed in correctly via formSG&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Notification sent to Work right and officer once Gazette request is submitted&lt;br&gt;-&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51);&quot;&gt; to confirm with Dept Reps - LRWD to confirm&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;3. Reports - summary (ie, list of all officers that are gazetted/degazetted)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 153, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;Boon Tat to provide the dashboard/report&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;3a. Monthly scheduled report&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;3b. Ad hoc generation of report&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 153, 0);&quot;&gt;Note: IA need to provide what fields they check so we can build the report for them&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Current manual work teams do - 1 to 2 days a &lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 153, 0);&quot;&gt;month&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;CMD also have a report that they maintain for authority cards&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 153, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 153, 0);&quot;&gt;4. Notification of statutory appointment - include link to egazette site - note to add that the link will be the gazette site and they will need to search for the specific publication&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 153, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(77, 153, 0);&quot;&gt;5. Bulk gazetting/degazetting - will be added in the backlog&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="440" width="310" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
